    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Restore Balance in a Chaotic City </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skyward Steps Together is a third-person multiplayer platformer game set in a city kept in balance by the mystical Harmony Stone. On a peaceful day, an unexplained surge of cosmic energy swept through the sky, a rare natural phenomenon unseen for generations. Overwhelmed by this surge, the Harmony Stone destabilized and shattered, scattering its fragments across the sky. With the stone broken, the city's balance collapsed, and peace gave way to uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As one of the city's agile parkour runners, you are the only hope for bringing back order. Your mission is to collect the scattered pieces of the Harmony Stone, reassemble it, and return the city to its former state of order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to four players can join the adventure and navigate challenging parkour courses to bring peace back to the city. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Mode </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can join the adventure either solo or with your fellow friends. Up to four players are supported. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Dynamic Skills </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect distant points with flat bridges to cross large gaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/c628ba5e32d5eff071b0c425508a517c.poster.avif?t=1753467572\" width=456 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/c628ba5e32d5eff071b0c425508a517c.webm?t=1753467572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/c628ba5e32d5eff071b0c425508a517c.mp4?t=1753467572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleport instantly between two points to bypass tough challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/4505f17a82804b8645bf17cecca09fc2.poster.avif?t=1753467572\" width=456 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/4505f17a82804b8645bf17cecca09fc2.webm?t=1753467572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/4505f17a82804b8645bf17cecca09fc2.mp4?t=1753467572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear obstacles and reach new heights with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/234dff4fc410a3f07301d7475c305d5d.poster.avif?t=1753467572\" width=456 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/234dff4fc410a3f07301d7475c305d5d.webm?t=1753467572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/234dff4fc410a3f07301d7475c305d5d.mp4?t=1753467572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Glider Mechanic </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Start with a glider to descend safely from heights.<br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Position yourself at strategic points to plan your route.<br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect small stone pieces scattered across the map to recharge your glider.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/04e541fd76d354db83c9348d1f7bbaca.poster.avif?t=1753467572\" width=456 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/04e541fd76d354db83c9348d1f7bbaca.webm?t=1753467572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/04e541fd76d354db83c9348d1f7bbaca.mp4?t=1753467572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Epic Quest </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gather larger stone fragments serving as checkpoints. <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Overcome diverse parkour challenges. <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Restore the ancient Harmony Stone to bring balance back to the city. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve the highest rank globally, either solo or as a team, by restoring the city's peace the fastest.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Restore Balance in a Chaotic City </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skyward Steps Together is a third-person multiplayer platformer game set in a city kept in balance by the mystical Harmony Stone. On a peaceful day, an unexplained surge of cosmic energy swept through the sky, a rare natural phenomenon unseen for generations. Overwhelmed by this surge, the Harmony Stone destabilized and shattered, scattering its fragments across the sky. With the stone broken, the city's balance collapsed, and peace gave way to uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As one of the city's agile parkour runners, you are the only hope for bringing back order. Your mission is to collect the scattered pieces of the Harmony Stone, reassemble it, and return the city to its former state of order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to four players can join the adventure and navigate challenging parkour courses to bring peace back to the city. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Mode </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can join the adventure either solo or with your fellow friends. Up to four players are supported. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Dynamic Skills </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect distant points with flat bridges to cross large gaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/c628ba5e32d5eff071b0c425508a517c.poster.avif?t=1753467572\" width=456 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/c628ba5e32d5eff071b0c425508a517c.webm?t=1753467572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/c628ba5e32d5eff071b0c425508a