_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/04e541fd76d354db83c9348d1f7bbaca.poster.avif?t=1753467572\" width=456 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/04e541fd76d354db83c9348d1f7bbaca.webm?t=1753467572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/04e541fd76d354db83c9348d1f7bbaca.mp4?t=1753467572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Epic Quest </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gather larger stone fragments serving as checkpoints. <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Overcome diverse parkour challenges. <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Restore the ancient Harmony Stone to bring balance back to the city. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve the highest rank globally, either solo or as a team, by restoring the city's peace the fastest.</p>",
